concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-repudiation-act-2023-sch-1-sec-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 Section 32A"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-2 ;
    values:originalText "Omit: • for certain conduct or convictions, the Minister can make a determination ceasing your citizenship if the Minister is satisfied you have repudiated your allegiance to Australia and that it would be contrary to the public interest for you to remain an Australia citizen: see Subdivision C (citizenship cessation determinations). substitute: • if you are convicted of certain offences and an order is made by a court that you cease to be an Australian citizen: see Subdivision C (citizenship cessation)." ;
    skos:definition "Omit: • for certain conduct or convictions, the Minister can make a determination ceasing your citizenship if the Minister is satisfied you have repudiated your allegiance to Australia and that it would be contrary to the public interest for you to remain an Australia citizen: see Subdivision C (citizenship cessation determinations). substitute: • if you are convicted of certain offences and an order is made by a court that you cease to be an Australian citizen: see Subdivision C (citizenship cessation)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "557dc0343e3c35d5bc4d9d4109aa95203521354b51ef93765d4a37b762f439e8" ;
    cof:pageNumber "7"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Ceasing citizenship for repudiation of allegiance and public interest." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <australian-citizenship-amendment-citizenship-repudiation-act-2023.pdf> ;
