    values:originalText "Insert:  (cb) if the Committee resolves to do so—to commence a review, after the Independent National Security Legislation Monitor  Amendments  Schedule 1 Amendments  Part 1  No. 109, 2023 Australian Citizenship Amendment (Citizenship Repudiation) Act 2023  completes the review under subsection 6(1F) of the Independent National Security Legislation Monitor Act 2010, into the operation, effectiveness and implications of:  (i) Subdivision C of Division 3 of Part 2 of the Australian Citizenship Act 2007 (which deals with citizenship cessation); and  (ii) any other provision of that Act as far as it relates to that Subdivision; and Surveillance Devices Act 2004" ;
